    "show_share": true,
    "description": "KARACHI, December 17, 2025 - Researchers from the Aga Khan University (AKU) have reported promising early results from a simple, low-cost household water filter that is dramatically reducing diarrheal disease and measurably improving nutritional status among children under five in rural Sindh, Pakistan.",
